# Scenario 'fuzz_register': replay of the useful entries of a coverage-guided input search (tools/trace/explore.py, docs/research/dynamic_tracing.md section 11)
# from the cartridge state left by 'register'; entries picked by tools/trace/fuzzpack.py (greedy set cover over the exact coverage of each replay).  Every segment starts with a
# power cycle; the random button sequences are plain macro lines (taps of 4 frames + 14 idle, waits, a few held combinations, sometimes a fake-Internet fault).
# 2 segments, 48 instruction starts that the scenarios before it had not executed.
# ---- segment 0: search entry e534, +34 starts, 4839 frames
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
wait 60
tap UP
wait 45
tap LEFT
wait 90
tap A
wait 45
tap UP
wait 90
tap LEFT
wait 30
tap A
wait 60
tap LEFT
wait 45
tap DOWN
wait 180
wait 60
tap DOWN x4
wait 30
hold B+SELECT+RIGHT 40
wait 30
wait 60
tap B x5
wait 30
tap LEFT
wait 45
tap LEFT
wait 45
tap A
wait 45
wait 60
tap LEFT
wait 180
tap UP
wait 180
tap A
wait 90
tap A
wait 180
tap DOWN
wait 45
tap A
wait 30
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT
wait 45
tap B
wait 30
wait 60
tap A
wait 60
tap A
wait 180
tap B
wait 45
wait 60
tap A
wait 180
tap START
wait 45
tap LEFT
wait 60
tap A x9
wait 60
tap UP
wait 45
wait 60
